It is the problem of using starting values from the factanal function. You may use the following command to use the starting values provided from lavaan:

efa.fiml <- efaUnrotate(dat,2,missing='fiml', start = FALSE)

I will figure it out why the factanal function does not work. Thank you for letting us know.

Sunthud

